    "Transactional applications like ERP, CRM, and ecommerce to log transactions and",
    "store structured data.",
    "•",
    "Amazon Aurora differentiator: Open source, high performance, and low cost",
    "•",
    "Analytic applications for operational reporting and querying terabyte- to",
