   "id": "P023",
   "texts": [
    "Key Takeaways",
    "• Amazon RDS support multiple open source",
    "and commercial database engines.",
    "• Amazon RDS instance class lets you choose",
    "the instance type (compute), while storage",
    "type helps you define the storage type, size",
    "and IOPS for the DB.",
    "• RDS Standby and read replicas provide",
    "enhanced availability and durability for DB",
    "Instances.",
    "• Automated backups and manual snapshots",
    "provide methods for backing up and",
    "restoring your DB."
   ],
